> Also, how do I get new pets?

If you find some domestic creature like a cat, a dog or a horse, you
can throw tripe rations or resp. apples at them to tame them.

You may also try to read a non-cursed scroll of taming while you are
adjacent to some arbitrary creatures. Some are easy to tame others
nearly impossible. You may also cast a spell of taming if you know
that spell.

You may apply blessed figurines of monsters that you occasionally may
find in the dungeons. (You may also wish for those figurines if you
have some means to do so and like that.)

I think it might also be possible to tame creatures using some music
instrument; but since I am not experienced with that I just restrict
my words to giving that hint.

